=2 Walkthrough
* You cannot start this quest if you have another {q:Weapon Skill Quest|WSNM|Weapon Skill Quest} active. You must return to the person that gave said quest and quit it to start another.
* Speaking with {n:Balasiel} at (F-7) will grant you the key item {k:Weapons Training Guide|Weapon training guide} as well as the {p:Spear of Trials}. You will need to break the latent on the {p:Spear of Trials} before completing the rest of the quest.

* Breaking the Latent:

::* With the {p:Spear of Trials} equipped in your Main hand, fight experience-yielding mobs ("Incredibly Easy Prey" or higher) and perform {p:Weapon Skills|Category:Weapon Skills} or close {p:Skillchains|Category:Skillchain} to accumulate 300 "Trial Points".

|^Skillchain Level|Points
|No Skillchain|5
|Level 1|7
|Level 2|9
|Level 3|11

::* You know you have enough points when the latent breaks. You will know it is done when the weapon's elemental resistances disappear from your active resistances (colored dots below the gear grid, but above the selected item description). **The item's description text will never change**.

!Broken Latent.png||
* Trade the {p:Spear of Trials} back to {n:Balasiel}. This will give you the key item {k:Map to the Annals of Truth}. You will be instructed to travel to {z:Sea Serpent Grotto}.

* Take {i:Silent Oil|Silent Oil|4165} with you and head to {z:Sea Serpent Grotto}. Make sure either you or someone in your party has a {q:Sahagin Key|Sahagin Key|Sahagin Key}.

* After entering the Grotto, head south into the first large room and take the southwestern tunnel. Continue to the south until you reach the Ornamented Door at (J-10). Unlock the door with the {q:Sahagin Key|Sahagin Key|Sahagin Key} and head south across the bridge. You will find the ??? to spawn the NM at (H-6).

* This fight is against {m:Water Leaper}, a pugil. It is weak to {p:Ice} and {p:Lightning} attacks. Once you kill it, re-examine the ??? to receive the key item {k:Annals of Truth}.

* Go back and speak with {n:Balasiel} to receive your reward.

